# The add-on image is built with the repository root as its context (see
# addon/Dockerfile). Everything is left out except what the Dockerfile copies,
# so a local .env, feeds.json, log or venv can never end up in a published
# image, and a change to the tests does not invalidate the build cache.
*
!LICENSE
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!src
!addon/rootfs
!addon/scripts
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
